    question: 'Can my boss see what I\'m doing?',
    answer: '<p>Not through a personal VPN on your own device. Your traffic is encrypted end-to-end. But if you\'re using company equipment or their corporate VPN, they might have monitoring software installed locally. VPN can\'t help with that. Check your company\'s policies if you\'re unsure.</p>'
